<title>USA: IPO PRICING-CCA Prison at $21, top of range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING-CCA Prison at $21, top of range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	  CCA Prison Realty Trust</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $21</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $19 - $21</p>
<p>   Number of Shares		     18,500,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	  J.C. Bradford &amp; Co.</p>
<p>NOTE: The proposed number of shares for the planned initial public offering in CCA Prison Realty Trust was raised to 18.5 million shares from 17 million shares previously.</p>
</text>
